Role: Full-Stack Java Developer
Location: Bengaluru, Karnataka, India
Experience: 2-5 Years

About the Role:
We are seeking a motivated and experienced Full-Stack Java Developer to join our dynamic engineering team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining our web applications from the front-end user interface to the back-end services. You will work in a collaborative, agile environment to build high-quality, scalable software solutions that drive our business forward.

Key Responsibilities:

Design and develop robust, scalable, and high-performance back-end services and REST APIs using Java and the Spring Boot framework.

Build responsive and user-friendly front-end interfaces using React.js, JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3.

Collaborate with product managers and designers to translate requirements into technical specifications.

Manage and interact with relational databases (MySQL, PostgreSQL) to ensure data integrity and performance.

Write clean, maintainable, and well-tested code.

Containerize applications using Docker and participate in the CI/CD pipeline.

Troubleshoot and debug issues across the entire technology stack.

Required Qualifications:

Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.

2+ years of professional experience in software development.

Strong proficiency in Java and the Spring Boot framework.

Hands-on experience with React.js.

Solid understanding of RESTful API design principles.

Experience with SQL databases like MySQL or PostgreSQL.

Familiarity with Git for version control.

Preferred Qualifications:

Experience with microservices architecture.

Knowledge of caching technologies like Redis.

Experience with Docker and containerization.

Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP).
